"543800c6-a4ee-580e-9c33-8b45574acf1b" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382239 1145 "The expected value of a discrete random variable $X$ with probability mass function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}x\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nLet $X$ be the outcome of the spinner. Then the support is $S={0,1,2,3,4,5},$ and the corresponding probabilities are all $\\frac{1}{6}:$\n\n$$\nf(0)=f(1)=f(2)=f(3)=f(4)=f(5)=\\frac{1}{6}\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =0\\cdot f(0)+1\\cdot f(1)+2\\cdot f(2)+3\\cdot f(3)+4\\cdot f(5)+5\\cdot f(5) \\\\  & =0(\\frac{1}{6})+1(\\frac{1}{6})+2(\\frac{1}{6})+3(\\frac{1}{6})+4(\\frac{1}{6})+5(\\frac{1}{6}) \\\\  & =0+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{2}{6}+\\frac{3}{6}+\\frac{4}{6}+\\frac{5}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{0+1+2+3+4+5}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382241 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382242 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382243 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382244 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382245 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1041 "selection" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382242 13194139536072 true] [17592186382240 1110 #uuid "f493148e-21ea-5b88-ab43-f87a8b490e0d" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382241 1034 "\\frac{9}{2}" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382241 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536072 true] [17592186382241 1111 #uuid "ec4a1d58-c63b-574d-b4c7-5fa87694d276" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382242 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536072 true] [17592186382242 1111 #uuid "0ef3a6ee-a2a2-5ef2-8fa3-5df42b629894" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382243