ch value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =2\\cdot f(2)+3\\cdot f(3)+4\\cdot f(4)+5\\cdot f(5)+6\\cdot f(6)+7\\cdot f(7)+8\\cdot f(8) \\\\  & =2(\\frac{1}{4})+3(\\frac{1}{8})+4(\\frac{9}{64})+5(\\frac{9}{32})+6(\\frac{5}{64})+7(\\frac{1}{16})+8(\\frac{1}{16}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{4}+\\frac{3}{8}+\\frac{36}{64}+\\frac{45}{32}+\\frac{30}{64}+\\frac{7}{16}+\\frac{8}{16} \\\\  & =\\frac{32+24+36+90+30+28+32}{64} \\\\  & =\\frac{272}{64} \\\\  & =\\frac{17}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382322 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382323 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382324 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382325 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382326 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1041 "selection" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382325 13194139536072 true] [17592186382321 1110 #uuid "07253c23-bcd6-5352-9c51-ac3842d87ea8" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382322 1034 "\\frac{37}{6}" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382322 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536072 true] [17592186382322 1111 #uuid "45bfde54-dfc0-5e76-b065-d8154b1cadf8" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382323 1034 "\\frac{14}{3}" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382323 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536072 true] [17592186382323 1111 #uuid "67258f0a-2caf-555c-86a1-c9a2aa8a4ab0" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382324 1034 "3" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382324 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536072 true] [17592186382324 1111 #uuid "2624952d-da11-5054-b8a1-2f1d2d292800" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382325 1034 "\\frac{17}{4}" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382325 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536072 true] [17592186382325 1111 #uuid "cb959328-1f0c-5cea-b186-3cfe5bba1c05" 13194139536072 true] [17592186382326